# UnlockAffiliate Docs Rules

## Source of Truth

- Keep `README.md` as the canonical local setup and project structure reference.
- Keep `AGENTS.md` focused on working conventions for contributors/agents.

## Documentation Hygiene

- Use placeholders for env vars; never include real secrets/tokens.
- Update docs when scripts, folder structure, or env requirements change.
- Keep command examples aligned with current `package.json` scripts.

## Project-Specific Notes to Preserve

- Runtime/package manager is `bun`.
- Frontend is in `src/`; backend worker is in `worker/`.
- D1 migrations live under `worker/db/drizzle`.
- Cloudflare bindings and vars are defined in `wrangler.jsonc`.

## Writing Style

- Keep docs concise and task-oriented.
- Prefer concrete steps and copy-paste commands.
- Avoid duplicating large sections across files when one file is source of truth.
